# Descriptor: [anti-B0 -> D_1+ l- nu, D_1+ -> D+ pi+ pi- pi0] gap mode
# NickName: B0_D1lnu_Dpipipi_gapmodes
# Documentation: Gap mode; three-pion contribution to semileptonic gap via D_1(2420)+, isospin
#   partner of decfiles/gap_modes/Bplus/D0pipipipenu (anti-D_10 -> anti-D0 pi+ pi- pi0).
#   Generated by the full-isospin generalization of the SEM/Hausdorff pipeline: same rough
#   3-body PHSP placeholder as the Bplus file, just D0 -> D+ (pion charges unchanged).
# Responsible: Philipp Horak
# Email: phorak@uvic.ca
# Date: 20260831

Alias D1pipipisig D_1+
Alias anti-D1pipipisig D_1-
ChargeConj D1pipipisig anti-D1pipipisig

Decay Upsilon(4S)
1.0 B0sig anti-B0sig  VSS_BMIX dm;
Enddecay

Decay anti-B0sig
0.500 D1pipipisig  e-  anti-nu_e  PHOTOS LLSW 0.71 -1.6 -0.5 2.9;
0.500 D1pipipisig  mu- anti-nu_mu PHOTOS LLSW 0.71 -1.6 -0.5 2.9;
Enddecay
CDecay B0sig

SetLineshapePW D1pipipisig D*+ pi0 2
SetLineshapePW D1pipipisig D*0 pi+ 2
SetLineshapePW anti-D1pipipisig D*- pi0 2
SetLineshapePW anti-D1pipipisig anti-D*0 pi- 2

Decay D1pipipisig
1.0   D+  pi+  pi-  pi0   PHSP;
Enddecay
CDecay anti-D1pipipisig

End
